    upstream PR      https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51113
    upstream commit  c56f169d9ae46ca420617e2cf5f0c9135da0f651 (merged 2026-08-06)
    upstream issue   #43559
    target file      /opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/v1/core/sched/scheduler.py
    image            voipmonitor/vllm@sha256:820181fbbc975cd5291c411cda9771d58fecee1636d916f508f47230df20592b
                     (gilded-gnosis-v20-vllm4d006a4-b12xcd3ce19-fi1ac6942-cu132-20260810-r34)
    vendored sha256  1ea341f4cc28d282452597c25d97eea84be8b5f984d2e1a6b548356c8417fdce
    patched  sha256  b431c1066dfee3ed56bfa7e71cc8606f9afadc300f22d7fc542c43835d1b22bf
    shipped as       tools/vllm-mamba-align-scheduler.py (whole patched module)

In mamba "align" cache mode a mamba slot p is defined to hold the state after
exactly (p + 1) * block_size tokens, and state is only materialized at prefill
chunk ends. The vendored `Scheduler._mamba_block_aligned_split` forces chunk
ends onto block boundaries only while `end < last_cache_position`. With EAGLE /
MTP, `last_cache_position` is backed off one block (and clamped to 0 for prompts
under two blocks), so the window between `last_cache_position` and the true end
of prefill is left unaligned -- while `KVCacheCoordinator` still publishes a
hash for one block past the aligned boundary. A chunk ending mid-block there
gets its slot hashed as a full-block state; a later request hitting that hash
restores a truncated state. Upstream re-gates both alignment rules on the true
prefill end (`prefill_end`) instead of the cacheable-range bound.

The vendored file is a fork variant: its comments differ from upstream's and it
lacks upstream's `max_prefill_tokens` / `long_prefill_token_threshold` relaxation
inside the guarded branch. Only the two reviewed behavioural changes are ported;
the surrounding vendored body is left byte-identical.

Hunk 1 introduces `prefill_end` and gates the block-flooring on it.
Hunk 2 makes an unaligned resume re-align unconditionally.

Apply with:  patch -p1 < patches/vllm-51113-mamba-align.patch

